                    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 500;">Tokyo, Japan[cite: 48]</p>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary); text-transform: uppercase;">Hours</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 500;">Mon–Fri, 09:00–18:00 JST[cite: 48]</p>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">Every message is answered personally, including outside office hours. Replies usually come within 24 hours, sometimes longer on auction days[cite: 48].</p>
            </div>
